TI  - Joining the pieces in childhood irritability: Distinct typologies predict conduct, depressive, and anxiety symptoms
AU  - Olivia M. Elvin
AU  - Kathryn L. Modecki
AU  - Jules Finch
AU  - Kylie Donnolley
AU  - Lara J. Farrell
AU  - Allison M. Waters
JO  - Behaviour Research and Therapy
