TI  - Does Moral Identity Matter in Situational Action Theory? Some Evidence of Iranian Fans’ Cyberbullying Perpetration
AU  - Saeed Kabiri
AU  - Seyyedeh Masoomeh Shadmanfaat
AU  - Kanika Samuels-Wortley
AU  - Owen Gallupe
JO  - International Criminal Justice Review
PY  - 2020
VL  - 30
